{"choices":[{"finish_reason":"stop","index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"My dearest Marie,\n\nThe Kassel post office was crowded, but I secured my place on the diligence to Giessen for tomorrow morning. It is a good thing, too, for the heat has been oppressive, and my head feels rather heavy after the journey. I have just read your letter, which reached me in time to sweeten the evening.\n\nI trust the boys are well-behaved. I must remind you to keep a firm hand on them; freedom is the goal of their education, not its starting point. If they learn to obey now, their own judgment will have weight later. Do not let them think they can dictate terms. The world will not be so gentle with them as you are.\n\nI am tired, so I shall retire early. I hope to reach Giessen before noon. I think of you constantly, even in this dull travel.\n\nYours faithfully,\n\nG. W. F. Hegel"}}],"created":1795218839,"model":"qwen","system_fingerprint":"b11429-d81235049","object":"chat.completion","usage":{"completion_tokens":193,"prompt_tokens":919,"total_tokens":1112,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0}},"id":"chatcmpl-R1G8xaleheuixKh3worR9Y1Tw89Sl6TV","timings":{"cache_n":0,"prompt_n":919,"prompt_ms":984.752,"prompt_per_token_ms":1.0715473340587596,"prompt_per_second":933.2298893528524,"predicted_n":193,"predicted_ms":4685.784,"predicted_per_token_ms":24.405124999999998,"predicted_per_second":40.97500012804688}}